    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d301-a4">

                <pb facs="0418" n="344" sameAs="frus:frus1866p2/pg344"/>


                <head>Mr. Nelson to Admiral
                        Pareja.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hotel Aubrey,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Valparaiso</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1865-10-18"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 18, 1865</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to announce that I have
                    this moment arrived at Valparaiso, for the purpose of seeking an interview with
                    your excellency at your earliest convenience. Will your excellency be pleased to
                    indicate the hour?</p>
                <p>The minister from Prussia and the secretary of my legation will accompany me.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to remain your excellency’s obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>THOMAS H. NELSON.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His Excellency the <hi rendition="#small-caps">Commander-in-Chief</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">of the Squadron of H. C. M. in the Pacific,</hi>
                            &amp;<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>., &amp;<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >c</hi>., &amp;<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
